infra Microservice Overload Demo
direction-tb

edge
  rps: 8000
  -> Gateway

Gateway
  ratelimit-rps: 5000
  -> AuthProxy

AuthProxy
  cache-hit: 60%
  -> [Services]

[Services]
  OrderAPI
    instances: 2
    max-rps: 400
    latency-ms: 80
    cb-error-threshold: 60%
  PaymentAPI
    instances: 1
    max-rps: 200
    latency-ms: 150
